<title>USA: U.S. orange juice stocks in cold storage - USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S. orange juice stocks in cold storage - USDA.</headline>
<text>
<p>WASHINGTON, April 18 (Reuter) USDA report of frozen</p>
<p>concentrated orange juice stocks in cold storage, in 1,000s of</p>
<p>units:</p>
<p>    -	 03/31/97   02/28/97--(Previous)   03/31/96</p>
<p> Gallons     175,852    169,525    169,874     133,618</p>
<p> Lbs	 1,740,235  1,677,619  1,681,075   1,322,281</p>
<p>Note-FCOJ stocks are based on 42.0 degrees Brix equivalent of</p>
<p>9.896 lbs per gallon.</p>
</text>
